---
const prototypes = [
  {
    title: "Marketing campaign prototype",
    description:
      "Built an end-to-end advertising campaign concept for a real estate use case, using AI tools to move from concept to polished creative output significantly faster than traditional workflows.",
  },
  {
    title: "Website prototypes",
    description:
      "Designed and built multiple websites spanning different content types and use cases, using AI-assisted design and development tools to go from concept to functioning product without a traditional build team.",
  },
];
---

<section id="ai-prototypes" class="px-6 py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <h2 class="reveal eyebrow text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[#a9791f] mb-3">Hands-On AI</h2>
    <h3 class="reveal font-serif-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#111827] mb-4">AI-built prototypes</h3>
    <p class="reveal max-w-3xl text-[#5b6472] leading-relaxed mb-12">
      Independently designed and built a range of AI-assisted prototypes to
      explore how generative and agentic AI tools can accelerate
      concept-to-output timelines across different domains.
      <span class="text-[#5b6472]/80">(Details under NDA; descriptions kept high-level.)</span>
    </p>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {prototypes.map((item) => (
        <div class="reveal card-elevate card-sheen spotlight rounded-xl border border-[#e3e6ec] bg-white p-6">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-[#111827]">{item.title}</h4>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#5b6472] leading-relaxed">{item.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="reveal mt-12 max-w-3xl text-[#5b6472] leading-relaxed">
      This hands-on exploration reflects a broader interest in how AI tools
      reshape the speed and shape of product development — not just as a user
      of AI features in products I manage, but as a builder using these tools
      directly, which sharpens my judgment on what's realistic to promise when
      AI capabilities come up in product roadmaps.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
